Quest 273 "2nd job change"
    Journal for warrior "I promised to bring [Warrior Master] Skaki collectible items."
    Journal for rogue "I promised to bring [Secret Agent] Clarence collectible items."
    Journal for mage "I promised to bring [Archmage] Drake collectible items."
    Journal for priest "I promised to bring [Priest] Minerva collectible items."
