Requires player level >= 60

Rewards for warrior
    Promote

Rewards for rogue
    Promote

Rewards for mage
    Promote

Rewards for priest
    Promote

On offer
    If player is warrior
        Show quest "Oh, it's time for you to undergo a 2nd job change? You have persevered well. Don't be lax as the true chivalric mission begins now. You need the ingredients below to perform the 2nd job change ritual."
    If player is rogue
        Show quest "You have finally fulfilled the requirements for the 2nd job change. You will be the pride of us rogues if you successfully complete it. Your road to becoming a true rogue master begins now. To complete the 2nd job change you need the ingredients below."
    If player is mage
        Show quest "Mages undergoing a 2nd job change are no longer governed by my powers. If you want that power go and collect the ingredients below."
    If player is priest
        Show quest "You're attempting your 2nd job change, how impressive... Your training thus far must have moved the gods. You need the ingredients below to approach the gods closer."

On in_progress
    If player is warrior
        Say "Not all the sacrificial offerings to hold the ceremony have been prepared yet."
    If player is rogue
        Say "You haven't collected all the sacrificial offerings to hold the ceremony yet."
    If player is mage
        Say "You haven't collected all the sacrificial offerings to hold the ceremony yet."
    If player is priest
        Say "You haven't collected all the sacrificial offerings to hold the ceremony yet."

On claimable
    If player is warrior
        Show quest "All the preparations are complete. I appoint you Berserkerhero. Do you want to change jobs now?"
    If player is rogue
        Show quest "All the items needed for the ceremony have been prepared.  I will confer you by the name of Shadow Bane.  Would you like to hold the ceremony right now?"
    If player is mage
        Show quest "You brought everything I asked for. Here... you will now receive the appellation of omniscient Elimentalload  Do you want to undergo the job change now?"
    If player is priest
        Show quest "You are equipped with all the materials needed for your 2nd job change. You have made a vow with the gods under the title Shadowknight. Would you like to perform the ceremony now?"

On completed
    If player is warrior
        Say "You have already completed the ritual."
    If player is rogue
        Say "You have already completed the ritual."
    If player is mage
        Say "You have already completed the ritual."
    If player is priest
        Say "You have already completed the ritual."
